{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLqg6XdFTJhvFoW5hXKA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for two fixes and two new frames. Frame 02's headline sits at 36/44 for 3 lines, so its 132 height ends at 616 and pushes the subtitle down to 762, where it collides with the CTA at 790. I resize the headline to 32/40 (120 tall) at y 566, ending at 686, with the subtitle at 700-744 and the CTA at 790. The splash logo stays as is; the suitcase overlapping \"in\" is the actual asset. In the design system, I move the Type scale heading to y 520 and start the rows at 556, raising the frame height to 800; the 5-per-row logic is correct because sx > 32+112*4-1 gives the 5 positions 32, 144, 256, 368, 480.\n\nFor 03_Sign_In I lay out a 430x932 white frame: a hot air balloon hero image to 300 with a dark overlay, logo at 24,58 (width 120), a language pill at 278,64, then a white sheet with radius 28 from 268. The headline \"Let's Travel you in.\" is 28 Bold at y 300, the subtitle at 340, the email field at 392 and password at 456 (358 wide, x 36), \"Forgot password?\" at 512, the Sign In button at 556, the \"or sign in with\" divider at 640, three 108x56 social cards at 672, and the footer at 780.\n\n04_Home fills 430x932 tightly: header and points pill, search at 108-156, the ticket card at 168-338 (170 tall), categories at 356-440, \"Journey together\" at 460, 220-tall journey cards at 492-712, the hotel heading at 732, a 108-tall hotel card at 764-872, and the tab bar at 872-932.\n\nI run the fix plus frame 03 in one call and frame 04 in a second.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3526,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":75704,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3526}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use